tichonids were a Frankish noble family descended from Adalrich, also called Eticho, Duke of Alsace in the later 7th century.</span></a></li><li class="enc-item has-img"><a href="/encyclopedia/etienne-de-flacourt"><img class="enc-thumb" src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/etienne-de-flacourt.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="56" height="56"><span class="enc-name">Étienne de Flacourt</span><span class="enc-type">Person</span><span class="enc-snip">Étienne de Flacourt was a French colonial governor of Fort-Dauphin in south-eastern Madagascar for the French East India Company from 1648 to 1655.</span></a></li></ul>
